# Shell scripts run on Linux (Cloudflare Pages build). A CRLF shebang fails
# there with a "bad interpreter: ...^M" error that is slow to diagnose, and
# this repo is edited on Windows, so pin the ending rather than rely on the
# working copy happening to be right.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Workflow and config files parsed by Linux tooling.
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Python and Markdown are edited on Windows and read by Linux CI; pin them
# so every touched file does not show up as an end-of-line change.
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
